  (text "Smart pen BLE tag - BC832 V1 (nRF52832). 2 x SR626W in series -> J1/J2. Separate passive NTAG213 tag is NOT on this board." (at 40.64 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1fc5f5c4-bec9-4fc7-bfa0-a678c8840b62))
  (text "Q1 = reverse-polarity protection (drain to battery, source to VDD, gate to GND)." (at 40.64 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0dd1de54-5e41-45f0-9750-739feef74fbf))
  (text "L1 + L2 = DC-DC inductors required by BC832 V1 (DCC -> 10 uH -> 15 nH -> DEC4). Enable DCDC in firmware." (at 40.64 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 51a84e32-e9be-4093-a3df-dafb34a02bde))
  (text "No 32.768 kHz crystal: firmware must use the internal LF RC oscillator. Battery level: SAADC internal VDD channel (no divider)." (at 40.64 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3ff473dc-3cd2-4aad-a8cf-9df87645dd81))
  (text "UNVERIFIED: BC832 land pattern (community footprints, not Fanstel's drawing); pin 3 = SWDIO per datasheet table. Run ERC before release." (at 40.64 50.80 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1fbc703a-ffd5-4e1c-9cc5-b783801e1f85))
